l mx-auto max-w-[760px] rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-black/25 p-8 text-center shadow-[0_0_0_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.03),0_18px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] backdrop-blur-sm md:p-10" data-v-f09b2b0b><h1 class="mx-auto mb-4 max-w-[12ch] text-center text-5xl font-bold leading-none tracking-[-0.04em] text-white md:text-7xl" data-v-f09b2b0b> We know how important elections are. </h1><p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl text-center text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200 md:text-xl" data-v-f09b2b0b> That&#39;s why we built civicAPI, a free political API that offers up-to-the-minute election results, data, race calls, etc for elections around the world. No API key required - start using it now! </p><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4" data-v-f09b2b0b><a href="/results" class="blueflashy min-w-[170px] rounded-2xl px-7 py-3.5 text-center text-lg font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_16px_35px_rgba(0,106,228,0.28)]" role="button" data-v-f09b2b0b> Results </a><a href="/api-documentation" class="redflashy min-w-[170px] rounded-2xl px-7 py-3.5 text-center text-lg font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_16px_35px_rgba(228,0,30,0.22)]" role="button" data-v-f09b2b0b> API Docs </a></div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t border-white/8 pt-6 text-sm text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b><!--[--><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" data-v-f09b2b0b><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-emerald-300" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-v-f09b2b0b><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" data-v-f09b2b0b></path></svg> Free &amp; open, no API key</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" data-v-f09b2b0b><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-emerald-300" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-v-f09b2b0b><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" data-v-f09b2b0b></path></svg> Global election coverage</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" data-v-f09b2b0b><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-emerald-300" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-v-f09b2b0b><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" data-v-f09b2b0b></path></svg> Live, up-to-the-minute results</span><!--]--></div></div></div><button type="button" class="group relative z-10 mb-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 self-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white" data-v-f09b2b0b> Scroll to explore <svg class="h-5 w-5 animate-bounce" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" data-v-f09b2b0b><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" data-v-f09b2b0b></path></svg></button></section><section id="home-more" class="mt-8 scroll-mt-8 space-y-6" data-v-f09b2b0b><!--[--><article class="home-card grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/8 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(8,18,36,0.96),rgba(5,11,24,0.96))] p-8 shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12 md:p-12" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="" data-v-f09b2b0b><span class="text-red-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em]" data-v-f09b2b0b>Live Results</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-white md:text-4xl" data-v-f09b2b0b>Live, Instant Election Results</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>From a local town council race in Japan to a school board election in Missouri, from a mayoral contest in Canada to a presidential race in Louisiana - we cover it all, US and beyond, updating the moment new votes come in.</p><div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-v-f09b2b0b><!--[--><span class="rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>Real-time vote updates</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>Worldwide coverage</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>County &amp; precinct detail</span><!--]--></div><a href="/results" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_16px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)] redflashy" role="button" data-v-f09b2b0b>See live results <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-f09b2b0b>→</span></a></div><div class="" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-black/30 p-6" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2" data-v-f09b2b0b><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-red-500 [animation:pulse_2s_ease-in-out_infinite]" data-v-f09b2b0b></span><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-red-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>Live</span><span class="ml-auto font-mono text-xs text-slate-500" data-v-f09b2b0b>62% reporting</span></div><div class="space-y-4" data-v-f09b2b0b><!--[--><div data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="mb-1 flex items-center justify-between text-sm" data-v-f09b2b0b><span class="font-semibold text-white" data-v-f09b2b0b>Candidate A</span><span class="font-mono text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>54%</span></div><div class="h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/8" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="h-full rounded-full" style="width:54%;background-color:#4f8ef7;" data-v-f09b2b0b></div></div></div><div data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="mb-1 flex items-center justify-between text-sm" data-v-f09b2b0b><span class="font-semibold text-white" data-v-f09b2b0b>Candidate B</span><span class="font-mo