items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/8 bg-white/[0.03] px-4 py-2.5" data-v-f09b2b0b><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15" data-v-f09b2b0b></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15" data-v-f09b2b0b></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15" data-v-f09b2b0b></span><span class="ml-2 truncate rounded-md bg-white/5 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-slate-400" data-v-f09b2b0b>yoursite.com</span></div><div class="p-6" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="rounded-xl border border-white/8 bg-white/[0.03] p-4" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-500" data-v-f09b2b0b> Embedded race widget </div><!--[--><div class="mb-2 last:mb-0" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="mb-1 flex items-center justify-between text-xs" data-v-f09b2b0b><span class="font-semibold text-white" data-v-f09b2b0b>Candidate A</span><span class="font-mono text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>54%</span></div><div class="h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/8" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="h-full rounded-full" style="width:54%;background-color:#f76d6d;" data-v-f09b2b0b></div></div></div><div class="mb-2 last:mb-0" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="mb-1 flex items-center justify-between text-xs" data-v-f09b2b0b><span class="font-semibold text-white" data-v-f09b2b0b>Candidate B</span><span class="font-mono text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>46%</span></div><div class="h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/8" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="h-full rounded-full" style="width:46%;background-color:#4f8ef7;" data-v-f09b2b0b></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div></article><article class="home-card grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/8 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(8,18,36,0.96),rgba(5,11,24,0.96))] p-8 shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12 md:p-12" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="" data-v-f09b2b0b><span class="text-red-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em]" data-v-f09b2b0b>Open API</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-white md:text-4xl" data-v-f09b2b0b>An Open API For All</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>We believe election data should be a public good. That&#39;s why every endpoint is free and open, with no API key, no paywall, and no account required to get started.</p><div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-v-f09b2b0b><!--[--><span class="rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>No API key needed</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>Free forever</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>Simple JSON responses</span><!--]--></div><a href="/api-documentation" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_16px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)] redflashy" role="button" data-v-f09b2b0b>Read the docs <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-f09b2b0b>→</span></a></div><div class="" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-[#050b16]" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/8 px-4 py-2.5" data-v-f09b2b0b><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15" data-v-f09b2b0b></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15" data-v-f09b2b0b></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15" data-v-f09b2b0b></span><span class="ml-2 font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400" data-v-f09b2b0b>GET /v2/race/12345</span></div><div class="overflow-x-auto p-5 font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b><div data-v-f09b2b0b>{</div><div class="pl-4" data-v-f09b2b0b><span class="text-sky-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>&quot;election_name&quot;</span>: <span class="text-emerald-300" data-v-f