edium text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>Built for developers &amp; journalists</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300" data-v-f09b2b0b>We&#39;ll tailor it to you</span><!--]--></div><a href="/contact" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_16px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)] blueflashy" role="button" data-v-f09b2b0b>Talk to us <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-f09b2b0b>→</span></a></div><div class="md:order-1" data-v-f09b2b0b><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3" data-v-f09b2b0b><!--[--><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/30 p-5 text-center" data-v-f09b2b0b><svg class="h-7 w-7 text-slate-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" data-v-f09b2b0b><path d="m17.25 6.75 5.25 5.25-5.25 5.25m-10.5 0L1.5 12l5.25-5.25m7.5-3-4.5 16.5" data-v-f09b2b0b></path></svg><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white" data-v-f09b2b0b>API</span></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/30 p-5 text-center" data-v-f09b2b0b><svg class="h-7 w-7 text-slate-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-v-f09b2b0b><path d="M8.25 7.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5H5.56l2.97 2.97a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 1.06L4.5 10.06v2.69a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-4.5A.75.75 0 0 1 3.75 7.5h4.5Zm7.5 0h4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.69l-2.97 2.97a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06-1.06L18.44 9h-2.69a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5ZM8.53 14.97a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06L5.56 19h2.69a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0v2.69l2.97-2.97a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0Zm6.94 0a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l2.97 2.97v-2.69a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0v4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75.75h-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h2.69l-2.97-2.97a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06Z" data-v-f09b2b0b></path></svg><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white